# OpenSCAD Customizer parameter sets. The GUI writes <part>.json beside the
# .scad whenever a preset is saved, which makes them personal scratch rather
# than part of the model. Scoped to where models live rather than ignored
# repo-wide, so a config file that ought to be tracked still can be.
*/parts/*.json
*/kits/**/*.json
